  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 10.0.1.5 - 2026-11-27\n- Added configurable Swagger server URLs via SecureHostUrl and Api2HostUrl secrects. Secure API documents use SecureHostUrl, while other documents use Api2HostUrl with the service route prefix appended.\n- Added JsonOnlyContentTypeDocumentFilter to handle response example in json\n\n## 10.0.1.4 - 2026-11-13\n- Added Swagger Definition for Ally Apis\n\n## 10.0.1.3 - 2026-11-06\n\n- Document 400, 401, 403, 404, and 500 response bodies as the nested error envelope.\n- Reference release package APF.Core.Clean.Common 10.0.0.12.\n- Fix 400 response OpenAPI bodies for `[ApiController]` actions with body-only parameters: detect inherited `[ApiController]` on the declaring controller type (Swashbuckle) and `ControllerActionDescriptor` (Scalar), and enrich description-only `400` responses from `[SwaggerResponse]`.\n\n## 10.0.1.2 - 2026-09-22\n\n- Added VersionHeaderOperationFilter",
